###  http://id.loc.gov/ontologies/bibframe/contribution
<http://id.loc.gov/ontologies/bibframe/contribution> rdf:type owl:ObjectProperty ;
                                                     owl:inverseOf <http://id.loc.gov/ontologies/bibframe/contributionOf> ;
